00:01:51.657 --> 00:01:53.380
but for confidentiality reasons,

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.260
let's not look into them right now.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:58.310
But let's rather focus on the
other side of my profession

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.743
and as all of you know
watching this channel,

00:02:00.743 --> 00:02:03.550
I also have this YouTube
channel Firm Learning.

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:05.980
For those of you who
see this the first time,

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.580
