00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.820
I talk about slide-writing
tips, Excel advice,

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.000
other career-related topics,
consulting-related topics.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.490
So, like and subscribe

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:22.150
if this is something that
you're interested in.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.800
And how the OKR system is set up

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.760
is that you always
start with an objective.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.240
So here, for instance, in
the first line, YouTube:

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.760
to become the leading career

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.210
and consulting creator on YouTube.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.490
But then you always have the key results.

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.080
So, you measure this objective

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.470
by achieving these key results,

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:41.350
which should be objective
and measurable in the end.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.320
So here, for instance,

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.900
how many YouTube videos I
want to create each week.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.810
So, I want to continue to
create one quality YouTube video

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.810
every single week,

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.600
and then I also want to do a
couple of additional things.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:55.010
So, to ideate and launch a new
content format for YouTube.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:57.310
So, stay tuned on what
that is going to be.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.030
I trust you will learn about it soon

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.480
over the course of the year.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.830
